          "title": "You'll want to know: सायरन",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सायरन — sāyran — \"a siren\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सड़क पर सायरन बज रहा था। saṛak par sāyran baj rahā thā. A siren was sounding on the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सायरन (sāyran) is borrowed from English siren, taken into Hindi as a masculine noun. Like a bell, a siren बजता है."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
