              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हड़बड़ाना — haṛbaṛānā — \"to be flustered; to rush in a panic\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सायरन सुनकर लोग हड़बड़ा गए। sāyran sunkar log haṛbaṛā gae. Hearing the siren, people got flustered."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): वह हड़बड़ा गया, vah haṛbaṛā gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हड़बड़ाना (haṛbaṛānā) is set by CDIAL under haḍabaḍa (CDIAL 13949), a word CDIAL gives for confusion and very probably imitative. It is the rush when nobody knows what to do first."
            }
