              "text": "बुझना — bujhnā — \"to go out (of a fire or light)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दो घंटे बाद आग बुझ गई। do ghaṇṭe bād āg bujh gaī. Two hours later the fire went out."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वह आग बुझ गई, vah āg bujh gaī."
            }
          ]
        },
