          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बुझना (bujhnā) is inherited from vijjhāyati, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 11703). It is the intransitive partner of बुझाना, to put out: you बुझाते हैं a fire, and the fire बुझती है."
            }
          ]
